-- ==========================================================================
-- REPEATABLE SEED DATA
-- Populates a realistic, edge-case-rich dataset for manual/final review.
-- Re-runnable: seed-owned rows (id prefixes 10/20/30/40/50/60/70) are deleted
-- and re-inserted every run, so stale rows never linger across script edits.
-- All event dates are relative to CURRENT_TIMESTAMP so past/future/ongoing
-- semantics stay correct no matter when this migration is executed.
-- ==========================================================================

